# data/ is NOT deployed — the /data/* rewrite in vercel.json proxies it from
# the VPS (accounts-data-serve.py behind Traefik), where live-refresh.sh
# republishes it every ~2 minutes with zero Vercel deploys. If these files
# were uploaded, the static copies would shadow the rewrite and freeze the
# board at deploy-time data (Vercel serves filesystem before rewrites).
data
